# Fixed-step steepest descent. r2030 and r2549 both take dr = sd_alpha * F, then scale so the largest atom move is max_move. sd_twopoint defaults off and the archive ini does not set it.
# Archive config.ini, the file run.sh copies, sets sd_alpha 0.04 and max_move 0.2. The library default alpha is 0.1. comments.txt says 0.001; that sentence is the LJ38 comment, and the client does not read it.
# r2030 stops when the Euclidean norm of the free forces is below converged_force. The relax log labels that column max force. r2549 names the same norm convergence_metric norm. The value is 0.001.
# report.sh counts a start failed at 10000 force calls. That is the problem cap. r2030 leaves max_iterations at its default 1000; the archive maximum is 360, so that default did not bind. This run allows 10000.
# HarnessCounter through ext_pot. Kernel is r2549 Morse::force. Fortran-linked r2549, unpatched.
counter harness
count_keys HarnessCounter
code EON (SVN r2549)
code_version r2549
commit r2549
algorithm SD
tuning archive
template eon-svn/morse-sd-stock
problem minimization/morse-bulk
reducer harness
cap 10000
n 100
par2_mean 196.4
nfailed 0
mean_calls 196.4
median_calls 180.0
force_calls 196
force_calls_min 95
force_calls_max 360
n_crash 0
n_divergence 0
n_cap 0
n_wrong_stationary 0
